# brokenglass - syncopated kick/snare, shuffled groove
bpm 136
swing 33
humanize kick 6
humanize hat 6
humanize oh 6
humanize clap 6
humanize snare 6
humanize perc 6
humanize bass 6
humanize stab 6
kick ..x..x..x..x...x
hat x.xx.xx.x.xx.xx.
snare ....x...x.x.....
perc x..x.x..x..x.x..
tune perc 400
bass b1! a1 . . g1! b1 d2~ f2! g2 . a1 f1 g1! g1 f1 a1~
filter bass lp 500 res 0.6
sidechain bass 0.6
